        "fields": {
            "question": 48028,
            "description": "We have to go to the border states, no matter what. Kentucky, Tennessee, hell I’ll even throw Indiana into the mix. These are crucial to keeping a victory for us in our grasp, and I’ll be damned if we let that slimeball co-opt our party twice."
